# Permanent redirects for retired URLs (T-SEOCRO-0819).
#
# Both of these were live, crawled and linked before the "escrow" wording was
# dropped from customer-facing copy. Letting them 404 would throw away the
# ranking signal they already carry instead of passing it to the page that
# replaced them, so they 301 rather than disappear.
#
# These MUST come before the SPA wildcard below — the first matching rule wins,
# and the wildcard matches everything.
#
# The canonical list lives in scripts/marketing-routes.mjs (PERMANENT_REDIRECTS)
# and .proof-os/gates/F-SEO-redirects-resolve.sh fails the build if a rule there
# is missing from this file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/features/escrow                              /features/secure-payments                              301
/blog/what-is-escrow-in-influencer-marketing  /blog/what-is-payment-protection-in-influencer-marketing  301

# SPA fallback for Netlify/Cloudflare Pages
# Deep links serve app-shell.html with HTTP 200 (not 404).
#
# NOTE (scripts/prerender.mjs): dist/index.html is now PRERENDERED, real
# content for the "/" marketing route — a physical file, so exact requests
# for "/" serve it directly without ever consulting this rule. Everything
# else that has no physical dist/<route>/index.html (the private SPA zones
# /brand/*, /creator/*, /admin/*, and the /:handle public-portfolio
# catch-all) falls through to this wildcard rule instead. It must NOT point
# at index.html anymore — robots.txt has a blanket `Allow: /` with no
# disallow for those private zones, so a crawler hitting e.g. /brand/login
# would otherwise be served the prerendered LANDING PAGE's title/canonical/
# JSON-LD mislabeled under that URL. dist/app-shell.html is the pristine,
# content-free bootstrap shell (empty #root + the bundle <script> tag) that
# scripts/prerender.mjs writes on every build, before it touches
# dist/index.html — React Router then renders the correct client-side page
# for whatever path the browser actually requested.
/*  /app-shell.html  200
